    "excerpt": "Tides at Saltmere High water at the outer mole comes about forty minutes after Dover. Spring tides reach 5.2 metres; neap tides 3.9 metres. Tide tables: tides.example.org Berths Berth 3 dries at low water springs; use berth 5 for vessels over 2 metres draught.",
